Addendum: Case File RSS-5238-C33

On 11/08/1991, Foundation personnel were summoned by local authorities to investigate the unusual circumstances surrounding the death of Leif Ivanovich (20) in Eugene, OR. Ivanovich was reported to have committed suicide in their parent's home. The recovered remains were unusually damaged and difficult to positively identify. Further investigation uncovered a journal indicating Ivanovich was an instance of SCP-5238-2, hereby dubbed SCP-5238-2-C33. Relevant portions of the document have been transcribed below.



